<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>アルミメルト — アルミニウム産業ニュースログ</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Zen+Old+Mincho:wght@400;600;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #EEEBE2; --paper: #FBFAF6; --ink: #171B21; --ink-soft: #5A5F63;
    --rule: #D6D0C0; --rule-strong: #B6AF9C; --masthead: #12171E; --masthead-ink: #EFEDE6;
    --bronze: #9A5326; --bronze-deep: #7B4019; --steel: #24455F; --steel-soft: #4C6E88; --brass: #A9863F;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --bg: #14161A; --paper: #1B1E23; --ink: #EDEAE2; --ink-soft: #A19C90;
      --rule: #33363B; --rule-strong: #454850; --masthead: #0B0D10; --masthead-ink: #EDEAE2;
      --bronze: #D08A54; --bronze-deep: #E0A876; --steel: #7FA3C0; --steel-soft: #4C6E88; --brass: #C9A968;
    }
  }
  html { scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:'Zen Old Mincho',serif; font-size:17px; line-height:1.9; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  .sans { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  .masthead { background: var(--masthead); color: var(--masthead-ink); }
  .masthead-inner { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; padding:30px 0 20px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--brass); }
  .wordmark { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:1.85rem; letter-spacing:.03em; }
  .wordmark span { color: var(--brass); }
  .masthead-meta { text-align:right; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.78rem; color:#B9B4A8; line-height:1.6; }
  .masthead-meta .vol { color: var(--masthead-ink); font-weight:500; }
  .subline { padding:12px 0 16px; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.86rem; color:#B9B4A8; }

  nav.cats { background: var(--paper); border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  nav.cats .wrap { display:flex; gap:26px; overflow-x:auto; padding:13px 24px; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.84rem; }
  nav.cats a { text-decoration:none; color: var(--ink-soft); white-space:nowrap; }
  nav.cats a:hover { color: var(--bronze); }

  .hero-photo { position:relative; min-height:440px; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; overflow:hidden; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); }
  .hero-img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .hero-overlay { position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,23,30,0) 0%, rgba(18,23,30,.25) 45%, rgba(18,23,30,.94) 100%); }
  .hero-content { position:relative; z-index:1; padding:60px 24px 38px; color:var(--masthead-ink); width:100%; }
  .hero-content .meta-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .badge { display:inline-block; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; padding:4px 10px; background:var(--bronze); color:#FBF7EF; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .badge.steel { background: var(--steel); }
  .lead-date { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.8rem; color:#C7C2B6; }
  h1.lead-headline { font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.6rem); line-height:1.5; font-weight:900; margin:0 0 16px; letter-spacing:.01em; max-width:22ch; }
  .lead-deck { color:#D8D3C6; font-size:1rem; margin:0 0 10px; max-width:46ch; }
  .lead-comment { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.86rem; color:var(--brass); margin:0 0 18px; padding-left:12px; border-left:2px solid var(--brass); max-width:46ch; }
  .lead-source { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.82rem; text-decoration:none; color:var(--masthead-ink); border-bottom:1px solid #8A8578; padding-bottom:2px; }

  .market-panel { margin:0; border:1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-top:none; background:var(--paper); display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); }
  .market-panel .cell { padding:18px 22px; border-right:1px solid var(--rule); }
  .market-panel .cell:last-child { border-right:none; }
  .market-panel .cell-label { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.72rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .market-panel .cell-value { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; }
  .market-panel .cell-sub { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.76rem; color:var(--bronze); margin-top:4px; }
  .market-panel .spark-row { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-top:1px solid var(--rule); }
  .chart-caption { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; padding:16px 22px 0; }
  .chart-caption .title { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); }
  .chart-caption .range { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.72rem; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .chart-wrap { display:block; padding:8px 22px 18px; }
  .chart-grid { stroke:var(--rule); stroke-width:1; stroke-dasharray:2 3; }
  .chart-line { fill:none; stroke:var(--steel); stroke-width:2; }
  .chart-dot { fill:var(--paper); stroke:var(--steel); stroke-width:1.5; }
  .chart-dot.accent { stroke:var(--bronze); stroke-width:2; }
  .chart-label { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:11px; fill:var(--ink-soft); }
  .chart-label.value { fill:var(--bronze); font-weight:700; }
  .chart-label.grid { fill:var(--ink-soft); }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .market-panel .spark-row { border-top:none; } }

  @media (max-width:640px) {
    .hero-photo { min-height:360px; }
    .hero-content { padding:40px 24px 28px; }
    .market-panel { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .market-panel .cell { border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); }
    .market-panel .cell:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  }

  .section-head { padding:44px 0 6px; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.9rem; font-weight:700; border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink); display:inline-block; }
  .grid-wrap { padding-bottom:20px; }
  .story-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:0; margin-top:18px; }
  .story { padding:26px 26px 26px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--rule); }
  .story:nth-child(odd) { border-right:1px solid var(--rule); padding-right:26px; }
  .story:nth-child(even) { padding-left:26px; }
  .story .meta-row { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .tag-text { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--steel); }
  .story.cat-invest .tag-text, .story.cat-sustain .tag-text { color: var(--bronze); }
  .story .date-text { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.74rem; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .story h3 { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .story p { font-size:.95rem; color:var(--ink); margin:0 0 10px; }
  .story .comment { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.82rem; color:var(--bronze-deep); margin:0 0 12px; padding-left:10px; border-left:2px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .story .source { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.78rem; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink-soft); border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .story .source:hover { color: var(--steel); border-color: var(--steel); }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .story-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .story:nth-child(odd){border-right:none;padding-right:0;} .story:nth-child(even){padding-left:0;} }

  .colophon { margin-top:40px; border-top:3px double var(--rule-strong); padding:34px 0 30px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:30px; }
  .colophon h4 { font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.82rem; margin:0 0 10px; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .colophon p { font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 8px; }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .colophon { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  footer { background:var(--masthead); color:#97927F; font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif; font-size:.76rem; padding:22px 0 calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); }
  footer .wrap { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="masthead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="masthead-inner">
      <div class="wordmark">アルミ<span>メルト</span></div>
      <div class="masthead-meta">
        <div class="vol">Vol. {{ volume }}</div>
        <div>{{ generated_date }} 更新</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="subline">アルミニウム産業の一次情報を追う、AI駆動の個人ニュースログ</div>
  </div>
</div>

<nav class="cats">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% for c in categories %}<a href="#news">{{ c }}</a>{% endfor %}
    <a href="#about">このサイトについて</a>
  </div>
</nav>

{% if lead %}
<section class="hero-photo" id="lead">
  <img class="hero-img" src="assets/img/hero-extrusion-billet.jpg" alt="押出プレスから出るアルミニウムの押出材">
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content wrap">
    <div class="meta-row">
      <span class="badge {{ 'steel' if lead.category in ['相場','地政学'] else '' }}">{{ lead.category }}</span>
      <span class="lead-date">{{ lead.date or '日付不明' }}</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="lead-headline">{{ lead.title_ja }}</h1>
    <p class="lead-deck">{{ lead.summary_ja }}</p>
    {% if lead.comment_ja %}<p class="lead-comment">{{ lead.comment_ja }}</p>{% endif %}
    <a class="lead-source" href="{{ lead.source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">元記事({{ lead.source_name }})を読む</a>
  </div>
</section>
{% if price_points and price_points|length > 0 %}
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="market-panel">
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="cell-label sans">LME 3ヶ月物(3-month)</div>
      <div class="cell-value">${{ '{:,.1f}'.format(price_points[-1][1]) }}<span style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;"> /t</span></div>
      {% if price_delta is not none %}
      <div class="cell-sub">前回比 {{ '+' if price_delta >= 0 else '' }}{{ '%.1f'|format(price_delta) }}%</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="cell-label sans">記録日</div>
      <div class="cell-value" style="font-size:1rem;">{{ price_points[-1][0] }}</div>
      <div class="cell-sub sans" style="color:var(--ink-soft);">出典: AL Circle ほか</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="cell-label sans">記録件数</div>
      <div class="cell-value" style="font-size:1rem;">{{ price_points|length }} 件</div>
      <div class="cell-sub sans" style="color:var(--ink-soft);">継続ログ中</div>
    </div>
    {% if chart %}
    <div class="spark-row">
      <div class="chart-caption">
        <span class="title sans">直近の値動き</span>
        <span class="range">{{ chart.start_date_ja }} 〜 {{ chart.end_date_ja }}</span>
      </div>
      <svg class="chart-wrap" viewBox="0 0 {{ chart.width }} {{ chart.height }}" width="100%" height="{{ chart.height }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="LMEアルミ3ヶ月物価格の推移({{ chart.start_date }}〜{{ chart.end_date }})">
        {% for g in chart.gridlines %}
        <line class="chart-grid" x1="{{ chart.pad_left }}" y1="{{ g.y }}" x2="{{ chart.width - chart.pad_right }}" y2="{{ g.y }}"/>
        <text class="chart-label grid" x="{{ chart.pad_left - 8 }}" y="{{ g.y + 4 }}" text-anchor="end">{{ g.label }}</text>
        {% endfor %}
        <polyline class="chart-line" points="{{ chart.line_points }}"/>
        {% for d in chart.dots %}
        <circle class="chart-dot" cx="{{ d.x }}" cy="{{ d.y }}" r="3"/>
        {% endfor %}
        <circle class="chart-dot accent" cx="{{ chart.max_x }}" cy="{{ chart.max_y }}" r="4"/>
        <circle class="chart-dot accent" cx="{{ chart.min_x }}" cy="{{ chart.min_y }}" r="4"/>
        <text class="chart-label value" x="{{ chart.max_x }}" y="{{ chart.max_y - 10 }}" text-anchor="middle">{{ chart.max_label }}</text>
        <text class="chart-label value" x="{{ chart.min_x }}" y="{{ chart.min_y + 18 }}" text-anchor="middle">{{ chart.min_label }}</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

<div class="wrap grid-wrap" id="news">
  <div class="section-head">その他のニュース</div>
  <div class="story-grid">
    {% for a in others %}
    <article class="story cat-{{ a.category_slug }}">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="tag-text">{{ a.category }}</span>
        <span class="date-text">{{ a.date or '日付不明' }}</span>
      </div>
      <h3>{{ a.title_ja }}</h3>
      <p>{{ a.summary_ja }}</p>
      {% if a.comment_ja %}<p class="comment">{{ a.comment_ja }}</p>{% endif %}
      <a class="source" href="{{ a.source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">元記事({{ a.source_name }})</a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="colophon" id="about">
    <div>
      <h4 class="sans">このサイトについて</h4>
      <p>YouTubeで配信予定のアルミニウム業界解説チャンネル用に、動画の元ネタをAIが自動収集・要約している個人アーカイブです。一次情報の要約に留め、詳細は各記事のリンク先で確認してください。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="sans">扱うカテゴリ</h4>
      <p>{{ categories|join('・') }}の5分野を中心に、AIが毎回自動でニュースを選定・追記しています。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>アルミメルト — AI駆動の個人ニュースログ</span>
    <span>最終更新: {{ generated_date }}</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
